  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for an IT support company. Ask about the device or system, the fault, when it started, and whether it is business or residential. Ask about backups and whether data loss is a risk. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed after diagnosis. Do not promise data recovery or a security outcome that is not in the reference answers.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much do you charge?",
      "a": "{price_note} We charge per hour or per job. Tell us the issue, and we will quote before we start.",
      "keywords": "price,hourly,per job,quote",
      "priority": 10
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer remote support?",
      "a": "Yes, remote support is available for most software issues. Hardware faults may need an onsite visit.",
      "keywords": "remote,software,hardware,onsite",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do onsite visits?",
      "a": "Yes, onsite support is available in [service area]. Onsite time is charged per hour, as shown in your quote.",
      "keywords": "onsite,visit,hourly,quote",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you recover lost data?",
      "a": "We attempt data recovery. The result depends on the condition of the drive, so we cannot promise a full recovery.",
      "keywords": "data recovery,lost,drive,condition",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you remove viruses?",
      "a": "Yes, we remove viruses and malware and harden the system afterwards. Tell us what you noticed, such as pop-ups or a slow computer.",
      "keywords": "virus,malware,pop-ups,slow",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you set up networks?",
      "a": "Yes, we set up wired and Wi-Fi networks, including printers and devices that need to connect.",
      "keywords": "network,wifi,printer,devices",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you support Macs?",
      "a": "Yes, we support Windows, Mac, and Linux computers.",
      "keywords": "mac,windows,linux,support",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do managed IT?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer monthly managed IT plans for businesses. We confirm what each plan includes before you sign up.",
      "keywords": "managed IT,monthly,plan,business",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do cybersecurity audits?",
      "a": "Yes, we run security audits and review your setup for weak points. You receive a written list of findings and suggested fixes.",
      "keywords": "cybersecurity,audit,weak points,fixes",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do cloud migration?",
      "a": "Yes, we move businesses to Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace. We plan the move to limit downtime for your staff.",
      "keywords": "cloud,migration,microsoft 365,google",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do backups?",
      "a": "Yes, we set up local and cloud backups. We also show you how to check that a backup has run.",
      "keywords": "backup,local,cloud,check",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "How long does a repair take?",
      "a": "Many repairs are finished the same day, and others take a few business days. We confirm the timing when we diagnose the problem.",
      "keywords": "how long,repair,same day,diagnose",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do smart home setup?",
      "a": "Yes, we set up smart speakers, cameras, and hubs, and connect them to your Wi-Fi.",
      "keywords": "smart home,speakers,cameras,hubs",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer emergency support?",
      "a": "Yes, emergency support is available for businesses. Ask us about the response times in your service agreement.",
      "keywords": "emergency,business,response,agreement",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Are you insured?",
      "a": "Our insurer is [insurer name] and our policy number is [policy number]. Certificates are available on request.",
      "keywords": "insured,insurance,certificate",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What areas do you service?",
      "a": "We service [service area] onsite, and we support clients remotely in [remote service areas].",
      "keywords": "areas,onsite,remote,service area",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you back up my data before a repair?",
      "a": "We recommend a backup before any repair. If one is not available, tell us so we can talk through the risks first.",
      "keywords": "backup,before repair,risk,data",
      "priority": 9
    }
  ],
